        "text": "theorem finite_amplitude_cone {c j v p : ℝ} (hp : 0 < p)\n    (hP : 2 < p * c) (hvP : v < p * c)\n    (hscale : 4 * c * v < p * (2 * c ^ 2 - (v - 2) * j ^ 2)) :\n    v < coneBound (p * c) (p * j)"
